# メタルギアソリッド (Metal Gear Solid, SLPM-86111/86112): the signs and kanji of the game's fixed font, by code.
# Two bytes, high first; a script takes the low 13 bits (0x4000 is set for a character drawn narrow).
# 0x81xx hiragana and 0x82xx katakana follow Unicode's order and are not listed. Read off the font's pictures
# in main memory (it stands in the order of the item window's words, which helps: 双眼鏡, 赤外線, 携帯糧食),
# with a second reader beside. Some forty of them came up in the lines played and were read there in a
# sentence; the rest rest on the picture and its neighbours. A picture whose reading stayed in doubt is left out.
